{"4279920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mellow Echoes:Lo-Fi Moments", "steam_appid": 4279920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279920/extras/3a7bbf3b55f90e791bc9f17e23ddb841.poster.avif?t=1776642341\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279920/extras/3a7bbf3b55f90e791bc9f17e23ddb841.webm?t=1776642341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279920/extras/3a7bbf3b55f90e791bc9f17e23ddb841.mp4?t=1776642341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mellow Echoes: Lo-Fi Moments is a productivity support game that gently accompanies you during moments of focused work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using tools such as Pomodoro timer to progress your own tasks and gradually unlock quiet everyday scenes and small episodes with your work partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm music and a soothing atmosphere wrap around work sessions that might otherwise feel a little dull.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Not Satisfied With Just Chill?: A Diverse BGM Selection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centered around chill Lo-Fi music, the soundtrack also includes upbeat EDM and piano classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely choose from a wide range of genres to match your mood and the task at hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your personal workspace to suit how you feel each day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ About Your Work Partner<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279920/extras/246197965f72be91194a298a77d69fa6.avif?t=1776642341\" width=500 height=190 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kanato, a young man who was searching for someone to share calm work calls with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you quietly work together while sharing time through your screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He does not speak much during work—never intrusive, never distracting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet as you continue your sessions, glimpses of his daily life and way of thinking slowly come into view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This comfortable sense of distance subtly enriches your work time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279920/extras/5686c5e6051292371d977fd78d4f6fb0.poster.avif?t=1776642341\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279920/extras/5686c5e6051292371d977fd78d4f6fb0.webm?t=1776642341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279920/extras/5686c5e6051292371d977fd78d4f6fb0.mp4?t=1776642341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management tools selectable by use case, including a Pomodoro timer, stopwatch, and standard timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To-do lists and calendar features for schedule management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich playlist covering multiple music genres</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable ambient sounds to deepen focus and immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story elements unlocked by repeating focus sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization options for your work partner’s accessories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※All game images are currently under development.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c